, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l63_fmOyt1gQ7kNvwHk4bxw&_nc_oc=AdoOe1XBKajyYr36hsULfT4qdtOGK7Wvm-NEPe7kZSYcdK77Kpl3IpXSzzFxGKfgdVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTOzvIJoYsLQAcnSVYuhABwhI83dd550O8RuY65ZiAGoQ&oe=6B0C6B77"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ebFEOLim3EQ7kNvwECBqX5&_nc_oc=Adq0mhps5iybPpKu7Xn3jD_GQs5hpX18K29lI1O01o2hzP5Dg5UQWbPAmNfXcf0UEj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT8Ga4GKqKbgcZ5ByVroztCet3-rgn96i82lbNitlx_XQ&oe=6B0C6D0A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nCg497jb_DsQ7kNvwEGrlIf&_nc_oc=Adpci31__VWib-BiL1CCZLu_Ss-epRgNQSYnbjSeR68a-DiBw0s3Zfh0f3aqfCXMeCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ8zNJ99SkBjZbMCiGqiScj9jUkhAICCiLefhRzLj-TVQ&oe=6B0C5A2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E7Sncv_rzZkQ7kNvwFkMZAh&_nc_oc=AdrskgrB09rEeihPdIOZ_mhhiN0Vy-BQPAzPYKY77UC3u378n7eP-sK0ljyo1pZiV2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTH-szuBtUab-1m8d1c90Ho9MJbqNYshYcc1FQZ-wesZA&oe=6B0C7BC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7BhrBkaCPG0Q7kNvwH5PdkX&_nc_oc=AdpSY5rk_KKHN_fyELTiu9QUlHdgL1zOac3JXGX4GkosGJR89B1coc9Dc97QZ2x321I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRYMRFYoMWhCYnbK5_ONfJVZhzEH2k_LoUcVbYU9p1p2Q&oe=6B0C7418"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Dav3Mve9bIQ7kNvwF08t8E&_nc_oc=Adq8KpSnoxC3RvnkM6cFobl8-BeKTBrADr